# When a native worktree (claude --worktree / EnterWorktree) creates a new checkout,
# copy these gitignored local files into it. .gitignore syntax; only files that match and are ignored are copied.
#
# Copying projects/ as a whole = the new worktree comes with real project data + the config DB.
# This is a "copy" not a "symlink": each worktree holds its own independent copy, so alembic migrations do not pollute each other.
# Cost: about 1.6GB per worktree (versions/ history + media account for most);
# arcreel.db is in WAL mode, so stop the dev server before creating a worktree to avoid copying an inconsistent snapshot.
# 原生 worktree(claude --worktree / EnterWorktree)创建新 checkout 时，
# 把这些被 gitignore 的本地文件复制进去。.gitignore 语法；仅复制匹配且被忽略的文件。
#
# projects/ 整体复制 = 新 worktree 自带真实项目数据 + 配置 DB。
# 这是「复制」不是「symlink」，每个 worktree 各持独立副本，alembic 迁移互不污染。
# 代价：每个 worktree 约 1.6GB（versions/ 历史 + 媒体占大头）；
# arcreel.db 处于 WAL 模式，建 worktree 前建议先停开发服务器，避免复制到不一致快照。
.env
.env.local
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
projects/
